<title>USA: Banco BHIF Q4 earnings per ADS doubles.</title>
<headline>Banco BHIF Q4 earnings per ADS doubles.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Earnings per ADSUS$0.46		  US$0.20</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Earnings per ADS$1.55		    $0.78</p>
<p>NOTES: Fourth quarter net income 4.0 million Chilean pesos versus $1.8 million in prior year.</p>
<p>Net interest income increased by 20.6 percent between Q4 1995 and Q4 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 net interest margin 4.7 percent versus 4.6 percent in Q3 1996 and 4.8 percent in Q4 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
